          "explanation": "Backing is support offered specifically for the Warrant when it's challenged — it operates one level removed from the direct Grounds-Claim link. The Qualifier (not the Rebuttal) expresses certainty ('probably,' 'likely'); the Rebuttal (not the Qualifier) states the conditions under which the Claim would fail.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quiz Check</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"220\" width=\"880\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Backing supports the Warrant —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">one level removed from</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Grounds → Claim</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Qualifier = certainty; Rebuttal = exceptions</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Distinguishing Backing, Qualifier, and Rebuttal by their distinct functions."
          }
