            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lesson 11 Takeaway</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"160\" width=\"880\" height=\"140\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Claim, Grounds, Warrant are</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the load-bearing trio</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"320\" width=\"880\" height=\"140\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.14)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"375\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Backing, Qualifier, Rebuttal</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"415\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">add honesty and precision</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"480\" width=\"880\" height=\"140\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"535\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Field-dependent standards,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">constant six-part structure</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"640\" width=\"880\" height=\"140\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"695\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sets up Lesson 12: probing the</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">warrant with Socratic questions</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Key takeaways from the Toulmin Model, and how they connect to Socratic questioning."
