            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quiz Check</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"220\" width=\"880\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No side to defend,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">no scoreboard —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">only clarity to gain</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Socratic questioning's aim is clarity, not victory."
